airport-database-sample uses separate licenses for code and data:

1. Original code, configuration, schema DDL, sample queries, tests and
   documentation: MIT (LICENSES/MIT.txt).
2. Generated dataset and original database compilation contributions:
   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt).
   Credit: RKajiyama, airport-database-sample.
   Source: https://github.com/rkajiyama/airport-database-sample
   Preserve source attribution and indicate modifications when sharing.
3. Upstream OurAirports data: Public Domain.
4. Upstream Wikidata structured data: CC0 1.0.

The CC BY 4.0 grant applies only to rights held by this project. It does not
impose new restrictions on upstream public-domain/CC0 material, and it does
not remove upstream notices. See SOURCES.md for attribution and scope.

Generated load.sql combines MIT-licensed export statements and CC-BY-4.0
dataset contributions. Treat it as a dataset distribution with this LICENSE
and SOURCES.md, rather than as MIT-only code.
